{"title":"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Homer began peeling a pile of 44 potatoes at the rate of 3 potatoes per minute. Four minutes later Christen joined him and peeled at the rate of 5 potatoes per minute. When they finished, how many potatoes had Christen peeled?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/0247db2b379161a744852c107bccfca349fe06d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 32 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 33 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes of Homer peeling alone, he had peeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc3ef1d5c3a148be42d25a67aa3f822e26201bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\times3=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> potatoes. This means that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/0834574e1635ef776b5f4f5ca9225ae21cfaf4a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44-12=32$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> potatoes left. Once Christen joins him, the two are peeling potatoes at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/3/c03abaf05e8ebbf49cd94ab4d7abfb54fae09608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+5=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> potatoes per minute. So, they finish peeling after another <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9c049172d82e3d8fddf273555c334b232529806.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{32}{8}=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> minutes. In these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, Christen peeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa1d03fdb764f24c1b13a4f02a5f6eca8be2cee6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\times5=\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" />20 potatoes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> minutes of Homer peeling alone, he had peeled <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc3ef1d5c3a148be42d25a67aa3f822e26201bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\times3=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" /> potatoes. This means that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/3/0834574e1635ef776b5f4f5ca9225ae21cfaf4a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44-12=32$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> potatoes left. Once Christen joins him, the two are peeling potatoes at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/3/c03abaf05e8ebbf49cd94ab4d7abfb54fae09608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+5=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> potatoes per minute. Because Christen's rate is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, she peels <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cec32e2151ea26abffb5511d9aff292ccfb03276.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5/8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> potatoes.\n</p><p>-N.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8\" title=\"2001 AMC 8\">2001 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Pr